{"lyrics":"[00:02.62](Hahaha)\n[00:04.86]Woah, woah, woah, woah\n[00:05.60]Woah-woah-woah-woah-woah\n[00:07.76]Woah-woah-woah-woah-woah\n[00:10.34]Skrrt, yeah\n[00:12.70]Same way she come (Same way)\n[00:14.96]Same way she leave, yeah (Yeah, the same damn way)\n[00:18.96]All women scum (Oh)\n[00:20.60]Get the fuck away from me, yeah (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:24.46]I was blinded by love (I was blind)\n[00:26.64]But now I can see, yeah (I can see, I can see, uh-huh)\n[00:30.38]You ain't never made me happy (No, no)\n[00:32.62]You just made me believe, yeah (Uh-huh, oh)\n[00:36.74]Realest shit I ever spoke, spoke, spoke (Yeah)\n[00:39.74]Realest shit I never wrote, wrote, wrote (Yeah)\n[00:42.34]Mixed the Perky with the Four Loko, woah (Yeah)\n[00:45.36]You're not supposed to mixed the liquor with the Narcos (Yeah, Hahaha)\n[00:49.08]Damn, that's to numb the pain from these (Yeah-yeah)\n[00:51.60]Scandalous bitches in my brain, I mean (Yeah-yeah)\n[00:54.78]All girls seem to be the same, I mean (Yeah-yeah)\n[00:57.92]Your girl still gon' give me brain, I mean\n[00:59.78]Phew-phew-phew, let the wind blow her out my life (Be gone)\n[01:03.84]Anything romantic turns to suicide, suicide (Yeah)\n[01:06.18]Phew, huh, let the wind blow her out my life (Be gone)\n[01:09.18]Anything romantic turn to suicide, suicide (Yeah)\n[01:12.70]Same way she come (Same way)\n[01:14.96]Same way she leave, yeah (Yeah, the same damn way)\n[01:18.96]All women scum (Oh)\n[01:20.60]Get the fuck away from me, yeah (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[01:24.46]I was blinded by love (I was blind)\n[01:26.64]But now I can see, yeah (I can see, I can see, uh-huh)\n[01:30.38]You ain't never made me happy (No, no)\n[01:32.62]You just made me believe, yeah (Uh-huh, oh)\n[01:36.06]You make me believe (Yeah), love ain't meant for me (Yeah)\n[01:38.98]This is crazy (Yeah), this insanity (Yeah)\n[01:41.62]Thought you was my lady, now you hate me (Hate me)\n[01:44.52]Still got the blueprints, yeah, no Jay-Z (Jay-Z